# 🔐 Defensive ignore — added 2026-10-13 by the security audit.
# This is a DEPLOY repo: we copy built pages in and `git add` them. Without this file a
# credential accidentally dropped in the working tree could be committed and pushed public.
# Protection is immediate and local — no push required for .gitignore to take effect.

# credentials & secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!*.css.key
.netrc
.npmrc
.git-credentials
*credential*
*-token
*.token
.tg-*
.x-keys*
.desk-key
.app-pass
vault/
secrets/
.secrets/

# browser / session state (live logged-in cookies)
*-profile/
.google-profile*/
.chrome-profile*/
streamyard-profile/
Cookies
Login Data

# local noise
.DS_Store
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.log
